            %p
              This means that the ordinary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjunction+counit"} adjunction counit
              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+morphisms"} identity morphisms
              and hence that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+adjunction+counit"} derived adjunction counit
              on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibrant+object"} fibrant object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
