                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C(\{U_i\})
              is assumed to be projectively cofibrant, and since injectively fibrant objects are already projectively fibrant, the condition on an injectively local object according to Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DerivedLocalObjects"}
              is exactly the same as for a projectively local object.
            %p
